Third-party assets
------------------
This repository contains reference photographs collected for visual comparison
only (references/img/). Copyright of those photographs belongs to their
respective owners (Xiaomi, 52audio, qooah, etc.); each file is listed with its
source URL in references/manifest.md. They are included under fair use for the
non-commercial purpose of documenting a derivative 3D model, and are NOT
covered by the MIT license above.

The 3D model, textures, HDRI and all source code in this repository are
original works generated procedurally by the scripts under model/ and are
released under the MIT license.
